    "rule_summary": "When both indirect and direct object pronouns appear together, the INDIRECT OBJECT PRONOUN always comes FIRST, followed by the DIRECT OBJECT PRONOUN. When the IO is 'le' or 'les', it changes to 'se' before a DO pronoun.",
